: "doc", "source": "issuance", "kicker": "Two state records reproduce the difference", "text": "Two state records", "mark": "Two"}, "wt": [0.0, 0.69, 1.11, 1.24, 1.53, 2.03, 3.02, 3.33, 3.63, 3.99, 4.39, 4.75, 5.68, 5.98, 6.23]}, {"scene": "b", "kind": "compare", "ref": ["suspicious[1]", "established[1]"], "text": "Both list underwriting expenses.", "t0": 20.77, "t1": 22.91, "shot": "s5", "visual": {"type": "compare", "rows": [["2022-0371", "$580,795.13"], ["2022-0372", "$36,176.47"]]}, "wt": [0.0, 0.45, 0.87, 1.41]}, {"scene": "b", "kind": "doc", "ref": ["suspicious[1]", "established[1]"], "text": "The two figures add to the exact discount in the offering.", "t0": 23.03, "t1": 26.21, "shot": "s6", "visual": {"type": "doc", "source": "issuance", "kicker": "Two state records reproduce the difference", "text": "Series C", "mark": "Series"}, "wt": [0.0, 0.15, 0.43, 0.89, 1.18, 1.3, 1.45, 1.95, 2.5, 2.59, 2.71]}, {"scene": "b", "kind": "doc", "ref": ["suspicious[2]", "established[2]"], "text": "The state issued a legal opinion seven days after the sale.", "t0": 26.33, "t1": 29.81, "shot": "s7", "visual": {"type": "doc", "source": "opinion", "kicker": "The opinion arrived seven days after the sale", "text": "May 19, 2022", "mark": "May"}, "wt": [0.0, 0.16, 0.65, 1.02, 1.11, 1.42, 1.94, 2.31, 2.64, 2.94, 3.05]}, {"scene": "b", "kind": "compare", "ref": ["suspicious[2]", "established[2]"], "text": "It said the entire premium belonged in the debt-service fund.", "t0": 29.93, "t1": 33.08, "shot": "s8", "visual": {"type": "compare", "rows": [["Sale", "May 12"], ["Opinion", "May 19"], ["Expected delivery", "May 26"]]}, "wt": [0.0, 0.18, 0.53, 0.67, 1.08, 1.55, 2.01, 2.1, 2.2, 2.79]}, {"scene": "b", "kind": "doc", "ref": ["suspicious[2]", "established[2]"], "text": "Delivery of the bonds was expected the following week.", "t0": 33.2, "t1": 36.08, "shot": "s9", "visual": {"type": "doc", "source": "opinion", "kicker": "The opinion arrived seven days after the sale", "text": "May 26", "mark": "May"}, "wt": [0.0, 0.49, 0.59, 0.72, 1.16, 1.35, 1.97, 2.1, 2.55]}, {"scene": "b", "kind": "doc", "ref": ["suspicious[3]", "established[3]"], "text": "The auditor rounded the gap to $617,000 and recommended consulting bond counsel.", "t0": 36.2, "t1": 42.28, "shot": "s10", "visual": {"type": "doc", "source": "audit", "kicker": "The auditors asked for a legal review", "text": "Bond counsel", "mark": "Bond"}, "wt": [0.0, 0.16, 0.61, 0.94, 1.05, 1.34, 1.49, 1.79, 2.23, 2.83, 3.26, 3.95, 4.26, 4.8, 5.34, 5.62]}, {"scene": "b", "kind": "quote", "ref": ["suspicious[3]", "established[3]"], "text": "The following audit marked the recommendation implemented.", "t0": 42.4, "t1": 45.16, "shot": "s11", "visual": {"type": "quote", "line": "Recommendation implemented"}, "wt": [0.0, 0.15, 0.6, 0.99, 1.3, 1.43, 2.13]}, {"scene": "b", "kind": "quote", "ref": ["suspicious[3]", "established[3]"], "text": "The public audit does not identify a transfer back to the fund.", "t0": 45.28, "t1": 49.06, "shot": "s12", "visual": {"type": "quote", "line": "Final trustee disbursements"}, "wt": [0.0, 0.15, 0.54, 0.85, 1.14, 1.57, 2.18, 2.27, 2.86, 3.1, 3.21, 3.32]}, {"scene": "o", "kind": "doc", "ref": ["suspicious[4]", "established[4]"], "text": "In 2025, the offering directed the entire premium to the debt-service fund.", "t0": 49.28, "t1": 55.03, "shot": "s13", "visual": {"type": "doc", "source": "sale2025", "kicker": "Two later sales show what changed", "text": "April 2025", "mark": "April"}, "wt": [0.0, 0.17, 0.51, 1.79, 1.97, 2.33, 2.76, 2.89, 3.48, 4.34, 4.53, 4.66, 5.35]}, {"scene": "o", "kind": "compare", "ref": ["suspicious[4]", "established[4]"], "text": "The August 2026 new-money bonds show the same change.", "t0": 55.15, "t1": 59.41, "shot": "s14", "visual": {"type": "compare", "rows": [["2025 full premium", "$8,352,332.70"], ["2026 full premium", "$19,859,662.95"]]}, "wt": [0.0, 0.23, 0.73, 1.08, 1.86, 2.33, 3.02, 3.28, 3.4, 3.69]}, {"scene": "o", "kind": "quote", "ref